From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Giuseppe Maggio <jertlok@proton.me>
Date: Mon, 14 Sep 2026 18:09:17 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] media: i2c: imx179: hold back the binned mode

At its 340 Mbps/lane rate Easel retunes cleanly, but the SoC never sees a
start of frame ("VFE sof timeout"), and sweeping the CSIPHY settle count over
28..52 changes nothing, while 3280x1846 at 540 and 3280x2464 at 648 stream
at 30 fps before and after the attempt.

Offered anyway, it is the mode libcamera picks for any small viewfinder, so
the front camera would show nothing. Leave it out of enumeration and format
selection until it streams.

Assisted-by: LLM
Signed-off-by: Giuseppe Maggio <jertlok@proton.me>
---
 drivers/media/i2c/imx179.c | 25 +++++++++++++++++++------
 1 file changed, 19 insertions(+), 6 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drivers/media/i2c/imx179.c b/drivers/media/i2c/imx179.c
index a226c1259212..2ae417b15037 100644
--- a/drivers/media/i2c/imx179.c
+++ b/drivers/media/i2c/imx179.c
@@ -647,18 +647,29 @@ static int imx179_enum_mbus_code(struct v4l2_subdev *sd,
 	return 0;
 }
 
+/*
+ * The binned mode (index 0) is left out: at its 340 Mbps/lane Easel retunes
+ * cleanly but the SoC never sees a start of frame, and a CSIPHY settle sweep
+ * over 28..52 changes nothing. Offered, it is what libcamera picks for any
+ * small viewfinder, so it would black out the front camera.
+ */
+#define IMX179_FIRST_MODE	1
+
 static int imx179_enum_frame_size(struct v4l2_subdev *sd,
 				  struct v4l2_subdev_state *state,
 				  struct v4l2_subdev_frame_size_enum *fse)
 {
-	if (fse->index >= ARRAY_SIZE(imx179_modes) ||
+	const struct imx179_mode *mode;
+
+	if (fse->index >= ARRAY_SIZE(imx179_modes) - IMX179_FIRST_MODE ||
 	    fse->code != MEDIA_BUS_FMT_SRGGB10_1X10)
 		return -EINVAL;
 
-	fse->min_width = imx179_modes[fse->index].width;
-	fse->max_width = imx179_modes[fse->index].width;
-	fse->min_height = imx179_modes[fse->index].height;
-	fse->max_height = imx179_modes[fse->index].height;
+	mode = &imx179_modes[IMX179_FIRST_MODE + fse->index];
+	fse->min_width = mode->width;
+	fse->max_width = mode->width;
+	fse->min_height = mode->height;
+	fse->max_height = mode->height;
 
 	return 0;
 }
@@ -681,7 +692,9 @@ static int imx179_get_fmt(struct v4l2_subdev *sd,
 
 static const struct imx179_mode *imx179_find_mode(u32 width, u32 height)
 {
-	return v4l2_find_nearest_size(imx179_modes, ARRAY_SIZE(imx179_modes),
+	return v4l2_find_nearest_size(imx179_modes + IMX179_FIRST_MODE,
+				      ARRAY_SIZE(imx179_modes) -
+					IMX179_FIRST_MODE,
 				      width, height, width, height);
 }
 
